WEBVTT

00:00:05.420 --> 00:00:08.220
Darling, open up your eyes!

00:00:05.420 --> 00:00:08.220
Darling me wo akete

00:00:08.220 --> 00:00:10.550
It is in this world's evil den

00:00:08.220 --> 00:00:10.550
Kono yo no aku no soukutsu de

00:00:10.550 --> 00:00:15.470
You shall receive a rare heart

00:00:10.550 --> 00:00:15.470
Tsuibamareru kokoro hoshikute

00:00:15.470 --> 00:00:18.310
Escaping is impossible

00:00:15.470 --> 00:00:18.310
Nige mo dekinu

00:00:18.310 --> 00:00:20.690
My imprisoned, pale-faced prince

00:00:18.310 --> 00:00:20.690
Yuuhei no souhaku no ouji yo

00:00:20.690 --> 00:00:25.650
I am a goddess

00:00:20.690 --> 00:00:25.650
Watashi ga megami

00:00:25.650 --> 00:00:28.150
Kami-chama Karin

00:00:25.650 --> 00:00:28.150
Mini-Goddess Karin

00:00:28.300 --> 00:00:30.940
In this ward, you have to poach everything

00:00:28.300 --> 00:00:30.940
Subete wa mitsuryouku

00:00:30.940 --> 00:00:33.320
With a hidden snare

00:00:30.940 --> 00:00:33.320
Usumoreta wana ni

00:00:33.320 --> 00:00:35.030
If you entrap them

00:00:33.320 --> 00:00:35.030
Hamerareru no nara

00:00:35.030 --> 00:00:38.450
You'll want to destroy them too…

00:00:35.030 --> 00:00:38.450
Konagona ni kudaite hoshii wa

00:00:38.450 --> 00:00:40.910
To die from natural causes or imcompetence

00:00:38.450 --> 00:00:40.910
Shi ni itaranu yamai

00:00:40.910 --> 00:00:43.450
It's all poison to your heart

00:00:40.910 --> 00:00:43.450
Shinzou ni ha pawazon

00:00:43.450 --> 00:00:46.120
A rose melting in the flames of purgatory

00:00:43.450 --> 00:00:46.120
Rengoku no homura de zero kara

00:00:46.120 --> 00:00:48.370
Let's redeem this world…

00:00:46.120 --> 00:00:48.370
Saisei shimashou

00:00:48.370 --> 00:00:53.420
A black dahlia in the nightless city's sky

00:00:48.370 --> 00:00:53.420
Fuyoru no sora de kuroi daria

00:00:53.420 --> 00:00:56.210
A lost delusion, a falling reality

00:00:53.420 --> 00:00:56.210
Shisuru mousou ochiru genjitsu

00:00:56.210 --> 00:00:59.090
Struggling in hell like an ant

00:00:56.210 --> 00:00:59.090
Mogake ari jigoku

00:01:01.050 --> 00:01:03.800
Darling, give me your voice!

00:01:01.050 --> 00:01:03.800
Darling koe agete

00:01:03.800 --> 00:01:06.100
For right now, our limits will have to change

00:01:03.800 --> 00:01:06.100
Kono ima sashichigaeru hodo

00:01:06.100 --> 00:01:11.060
If we want for the most important thing

00:01:06.100 --> 00:01:11.060
Daiji na mono ga hoshii no nara

00:01:11.060 --> 00:01:13.860
Discover the result of your prayers

00:01:11.060 --> 00:01:13.860
Inori wa hatete

00:01:13.860 --> 00:01:16.230
Your princess is dying in prison

00:01:13.860 --> 00:01:16.230
Rougoku de shouten no himegimi

00:01:16.230 --> 00:01:21.280
You are such a devil…

00:01:16.230 --> 00:01:21.280
Anata ga maou

00:01:21.280 --> 00:01:23.780
Hate's fist and grief's wounds, too

00:01:21.280 --> 00:01:23.780
Ikari no ken mo nageki no kizu mo

00:01:23.780 --> 00:01:29.960
Dissolving, vanishing, unraveling, passing away, without a trace

00:01:23.780 --> 00:01:29.960
Atokata mo naku tokete kiete chitte utakata

00:01:31.340 --> 00:01:35.690
Himeka-chan's Secret

00:02:02.780 --> 00:02:04.740
Kazune-kun…

00:02:04.740 --> 00:02:07.540
I can't run any further…

00:02:07.540 --> 00:02:08.750
Alright, we're done!

00:02:09.750 --> 00:02:11.250
Thank goodness.

00:02:11.250 --> 00:02:13.500
Now we'll keep it up with these stairs!

00:02:16.840 --> 00:02:19.220
Isn't this…

00:02:19.220 --> 00:02:20.260
Bunny hop it!

00:02:29.140 --> 00:02:31.600
Don't get exhausted just after two!

00:02:31.600 --> 00:02:34.270
Even if you say that…

00:02:34.270 --> 00:02:36.400
Just rope twenty times for thirty minutes!

00:02:39.030 --> 00:02:40.700
Pull a steamroller while wearing steel sandals!

00:02:40.700 --> 00:02:42.870
Why?!

00:02:42.870 --> 00:02:45.240
And this is also for the goddess' workout!

00:02:45.240 --> 00:02:46.790
No!

00:02:46.790 --> 00:02:49.790
Is all this really going to help my powers as a goddess?!

00:02:49.790 --> 00:02:50.750
Listen up!

00:02:51.120 --> 00:02:55.500
For a weak girl like you to use goddess powers properly…

00:02:55.500 --> 00:02:57.770
…you need to build up your athletic ability!

00:02:57.870 --> 00:02:59.170
Do you understand?

00:03:05.350 --> 00:03:07.810
Alright! Morning exercises completed!

00:03:08.390 --> 00:03:15.320
If you're going to call me a weak girl, at least be a little kinder about it.

00:03:15.650 --> 00:03:16.770
Come on, stand up.

00:03:17.320 --> 00:03:21.110
If we don't hurry with breakfast, we'll be late for the welcoming ceremony.

00:03:23.870 --> 00:03:24.990
Thanks.

00:03:27.490 --> 00:03:31.250
Karin-chan, please wait a little longer.

00:03:38.590 --> 00:03:44.090
It's been bothering me but the only adult here is that butler, isn't it?

00:03:44.090 --> 00:03:50.730
Yes, but Kyuu-chan takes care of the house…

00:03:52.850 --> 00:03:59.230
I heard that Himeka-chan doesn't have parents and lives here with Kazune-kun, but…

00:03:59.650 --> 00:04:01.740
What about Kazune-kun's parents?

00:04:01.740 --> 00:04:04.610
But I get the feeling that I shouldn't ask.

00:04:05.200 --> 00:04:09.330
Ah, I made these tamagoyaki.

00:04:11.830 --> 00:04:14.620
Ouch… what was that for?

00:04:14.620 --> 00:04:17.130
You can't just eat like that Karin-chan.

00:04:17.130 --> 00:04:20.880
We have to properly start with "Itadakimasu" first.

00:04:20.880 --> 00:04:23.550
I-I'm sorry.

00:04:23.550 --> 00:04:26.010
Well then…

00:04:26.010 --> 00:04:28.390
Itadakimasu!

00:04:29.890 --> 00:04:33.390
Delicious! Himeka-chan's cooking is great!

00:04:33.890 --> 00:04:37.810
If you like, you can have my share too.

00:04:37.810 --> 00:04:38.980
That's my share.

00:04:41.190 --> 00:04:43.490
~Thish ish delichuch too!~

00:04:43.860 --> 00:04:47.870
If you like, you can have my share too.

00:04:47.870 --> 00:04:49.240
That's my share too.

00:04:53.830 --> 00:04:55.330
Karin-chan…

00:04:56.080 --> 00:04:58.790
There's some soy sauce on your mouth…

00:04:59.290 --> 00:05:00.790
How unappealing.

00:05:00.790 --> 00:05:02.760
What do you care…

00:05:02.760 --> 00:05:07.010
Kazune-chan has some on his mouth too…

00:05:09.970 --> 00:05:11.240
Hypocrite.

00:05:11.240 --> 00:05:13.020
Shut up!

00:05:13.600 --> 00:05:18.810
With everyone here, we seem like a family, don't we?

00:05:19.650 --> 00:05:22.530
Like a… family?

00:05:28.110 --> 00:05:31.990
Sakuragaoka Private Academy: Junior High.

00:05:33.040 --> 00:05:39.170
To think that I could enter this elite school… It's so unreal that it's a dream that I've never even dreamed before.

00:05:39.500 --> 00:05:41.670
We had to pull some strings after all…

00:05:41.670 --> 00:05:43.760
Don't tell me you bribed me into the headmaster!

00:05:45.260 --> 00:05:46.930
It was nothing like that!

00:05:46.930 --> 00:05:50.300
Whatever, as long as I get to attend here!

00:05:51.430 --> 00:05:53.680
For now, youth go!

00:05:53.680 --> 00:05:54.880
Go!

00:05:54.880 --> 00:05:56.480
You two…

00:06:00.650 --> 00:06:02.520
Kujyou-kun!

00:06:03.650 --> 00:06:05.650
The Kazunezu have arrived!

00:06:06.360 --> 00:06:07.700
Kazunezu?

00:06:07.700 --> 00:06:11.030
Hey, hey, I'm in the same class as you Kujyou-kun!

00:06:11.030 --> 00:06:12.580
The same class!

00:06:12.580 --> 00:06:16.410
Ahh… I'm in a different class… what a shock!

00:06:16.410 --> 00:06:17.710
A shock!

00:06:17.710 --> 00:06:19.790
Please watch over us this year!

00:06:19.790 --> 00:06:20.920
Please do!

00:06:20.920 --> 00:06:22.170
Yeah.

00:06:22.170 --> 00:06:24.800
Ahh, Kujyou-kun's so cold!

00:06:24.800 --> 00:06:26.510
Cold!

00:06:26.510 --> 00:06:27.720
You're making me go numb!

00:06:27.720 --> 00:06:29.470
Numb!

00:06:29.980 --> 00:06:33.850
Is that… his fan club?

00:06:33.850 --> 00:06:37.270
They have been since elementary school.

00:06:37.270 --> 00:06:38.140
What?!

00:06:38.340 --> 00:06:43.650
That guy always going on about girls this and girls that!

00:06:43.650 --> 00:06:45.280
I'll show him divine punishment!

00:06:46.320 --> 00:06:49.240
Ah… let us come with you!

00:06:50.200 --> 00:06:55.080
Continuing, the student council president would like to welcome the new students.

00:06:56.830 --> 00:07:01.120
New students, congratulations on being accepted.

00:07:02.630 --> 00:07:05.340
I'm the student council president, Karasuma Kirio.

00:07:07.170 --> 00:07:10.050
It's that person! The tree climbing glasses guy!

00:07:13.260 --> 00:07:15.860
To think that the enemy is the student council president of our school…

00:07:15.960 --> 00:07:19.100
I need to find Himeka-chan and Kazune-kun quickly and make a counter-plan!

00:07:23.020 --> 00:07:25.940
Where did those two go?

00:07:26.520 --> 00:07:27.780
Kazunezu.

00:07:28.070 --> 00:07:29.490
Excuse me…

00:07:29.490 --> 00:07:31.200
…have you seen Kazune-ku…

00:07:32.070 --> 00:07:33.360
Kazune-kun?

00:07:33.360 --> 00:07:36.370
Don't call Kujyou-kun by his first name.

00:07:36.370 --> 00:07:39.370
You were with Kujyou-kun at the school gates earlier this morning too.

00:07:39.370 --> 00:07:40.500
You're an eyesore!

00:07:40.500 --> 00:07:41.870
An eyesore!

00:07:43.580 --> 00:07:49.710
Let me tell you, that us Kazunezu aren't new like you.

00:07:49.710 --> 00:07:52.260
We've known Kujyou-kun since long ago.

00:07:52.590 --> 00:07:56.260
Don't get too friendly when you've just met him!

00:07:56.260 --> 00:07:57.810
Don't!

00:07:58.720 --> 00:08:00.980
Sorry for disturbing!

00:08:06.110 --> 00:08:07.570
Was that Karin?

00:08:10.900 --> 00:08:13.150
Kazune-kun isn't anywhere…

00:08:14.410 --> 00:08:15.490
Himeka-chan!

00:08:16.200 --> 00:08:17.660
Karin-chan!

00:08:18.080 --> 00:08:19.660
Hey, hey, I'm looking for Kazune-kun…

00:08:19.660 --> 00:08:20.700
Karin-chan?

00:08:22.210 --> 00:08:24.960
This is Hanazono Karin-chan.

00:08:26.290 --> 00:08:27.210
Pleased to meet you!

00:08:27.210 --> 00:08:29.710
Me too, I'm Hanazono.

00:08:30.300 --> 00:08:34.630
This is my friend from elementary school, Miyon-chan.

00:08:34.630 --> 00:08:38.350
Ah! Yeah, yeah! You know that Gorilla-sensei from elementary school…

00:08:38.350 --> 00:08:40.390
Gomi-sensei, wasn't it?

00:08:41.350 --> 00:08:42.770
Was that it?

00:08:42.770 --> 00:08:46.770
And so, what about Gorilla-sensei?

00:08:46.770 --> 00:08:48.520
Gomi-sensei, wasn't it?

00:09:00.910 --> 00:09:04.160
We've known Kujyou-kun since long ago.

00:09:04.160 --> 00:09:08.210
Yeah, yeah, Himeka-chan! That Gorilla-sensei from elementary school…

00:09:12.260 --> 00:09:18.760
That's right. Kazune-kun and Himeka-chan have always lived in this city.

00:09:19.800 --> 00:09:24.270
Of course there will be lots of new faces.

00:09:31.190 --> 00:09:36.110
I guess, I'm the only one who took "family" to heart.

00:09:44.250 --> 00:09:45.250
Shii-chan.

00:09:52.550 --> 00:09:56.260
I might be a little lonely.

00:09:57.300 --> 00:09:58.510
Are you crying?

00:10:07.730 --> 00:10:08.720
Is it grilled
eel over rice?

00:10:09.800 --> 00:10:12.260
I am God!

00:10:15.970 --> 00:10:17.220
You moron.

00:10:16.200 --> 00:10:17.220
It's a croquette!

00:10:20.700 --> 00:10:23.910
Tears don't look good on girls.

00:10:34.630 --> 00:10:37.090
He's here… he was here…

00:10:38.130 --> 00:10:41.300
I gave up because I thought he didn't exist in this world…

00:10:41.890 --> 00:10:44.600
But he's really here!

00:10:44.600 --> 00:10:48.430
My P-R-I-N-C-E!

00:10:51.300 --> 00:10:53.430
Student Council Office

00:10:56.780 --> 00:10:58.440
Did you see her, Kirika?

00:10:59.530 --> 00:11:04.660
Yeah, but is she really a goddess? Isn't she just a normal girl?

00:11:05.490 --> 00:11:06.870
Do you want to go find out?

00:11:15.340 --> 00:11:17.170
Kujyou-kun!

00:11:19.050 --> 00:11:21.550
Himeka-chan! Guess what, guess what!

00:11:27.850 --> 00:11:31.390
It's fine, I'll just go home alone.

00:11:34.900 --> 00:11:38.800
I have my prince after all!

00:11:38.800 --> 00:11:41.530
I wonder if I'll meet him again…

00:11:47.790 --> 00:11:50.080
It can't be… my prince?

00:11:57.590 --> 00:11:59.010
This is unbelievable.

00:12:00.380 --> 00:12:01.630
Who are you?

00:12:02.380 --> 00:12:04.760
I'm a goddess.

00:12:05.720 --> 00:12:09.560
It can't be. There are other goddesses besides me?

00:12:10.270 --> 00:12:12.350
That's right, are you surprised?

00:12:17.020 --> 00:12:20.570
That's the same as that tree climbing glasses guy's attack!

00:12:26.620 --> 00:12:28.660
As I suspected, it's not her is it?

00:12:29.580 --> 00:12:32.250
However it bothers me that can she see me in this form though…

00:12:35.750 --> 00:12:38.090
What should I do?

00:12:41.210 --> 00:12:45.090
Now that it's come to this, succeed or fail, I've no choice but to transform into a goddess!

00:12:47.680 --> 00:12:48.810
But how?

00:12:49.760 --> 00:12:51.640
I don't understand!

00:12:51.640 --> 00:12:53.480
For now, focus your prayers on protecting something.

00:12:54.060 --> 00:12:57.400
Protect… to protect…

00:12:58.020 --> 00:13:01.110
I… I have to protect myself!

00:13:03.110 --> 00:13:05.450
I am God!

00:13:31.100 --> 00:13:32.270
Where did she come from?

00:13:33.470 --> 00:13:34.600
Is it that girl?

00:13:35.140 --> 00:13:38.480
Alright… I-I'm gonna do it!

00:13:39.360 --> 00:13:40.980
If you're also a goddess, I'll show no mercy.

00:13:41.820 --> 00:13:43.230
Terebro Nox!

00:13:47.740 --> 00:13:50.030
That singed my hair a little!

00:13:50.030 --> 00:13:53.450
Scorching the hair of a goddess! Wait this isn't the time for puns!

00:13:50.030 --> 00:13:53.450
"Kami" - God, also "Kami" - hair

00:13:53.830 --> 00:13:55.410
A noisy goddess, aren't you?

00:13:55.660 --> 00:13:58.340
Alright, my turn!

00:13:58.340 --> 00:14:02.340
God Thunder!

00:14:05.880 --> 00:14:07.680
What? Nothing came out.

00:14:07.680 --> 00:14:09.590
Huh? What?

00:14:11.850 --> 00:14:13.250
One more time!

00:14:13.250 --> 00:14:17.020
God Thunder!

00:14:17.690 --> 00:14:21.020
It's not coming out! Why?!

00:14:21.940 --> 00:14:25.900
Oh right, up until now Kazune-kun has been with me…

00:14:26.990 --> 00:14:29.780
I can't do anything by myself…

00:14:30.870 --> 00:14:32.740
Anything more is a waste of time.

00:14:34.580 --> 00:14:35.540
Farewell.

00:14:39.000 --> 00:14:40.920
Save me, Kazune-kun!

00:14:54.260 --> 00:14:55.850
Kazune-kun!

00:14:56.770 --> 00:14:59.140
So you're come, Sun God.

00:14:59.560 --> 00:15:01.730
You're a god too, Kazune-kun?

00:15:02.770 --> 00:15:04.860
Don't just sit there! Hurry and run for it!

00:15:12.910 --> 00:15:14.240
You're an eyesore!

00:15:14.240 --> 00:15:15.870
The same to you!

00:15:17.250 --> 00:15:18.200
Terebro Nox!

00:15:26.960 --> 00:15:28.510
Sagitta Solis!

00:15:36.310 --> 00:15:36.990
Wow…

00:15:36.990 --> 00:15:37.890
Hurry up!

00:15:45.110 --> 00:15:46.650
They got away, huh?

00:15:51.610 --> 00:15:52.950
This far should be fine.

00:15:54.910 --> 00:15:57.540
Don't get into fights, you moron!

00:15:57.540 --> 00:16:00.460
Don't talk to me like that!

00:16:00.460 --> 00:16:02.620
They attacked first!

00:16:02.620 --> 00:16:07.250
But anyway, if you're so strong, why didn't you use such powers before...

00:16:08.670 --> 00:16:10.470
K-Kazune-kun!

00:16:12.090 --> 00:16:15.510
His ring looks similar to mine…

00:16:19.470 --> 00:16:20.600
Well?

00:16:21.810 --> 00:16:25.480
It's certain that an unknown goddess showed herself before Nyx.

00:16:26.060 --> 00:16:29.730
However, it's uncertain whether or not that girl is the goddess.

00:16:30.990 --> 00:16:34.860
You're incredibly doubtful of her, even after she did that.

00:16:35.820 --> 00:16:42.000
You might be right, and it's two versus two now that another has joined their side.

00:16:42.750 --> 00:16:43.830
This will be troublesome.

00:16:44.290 --> 00:16:47.750
What? This new goddess is nothing more than an amateur.

00:16:48.090 --> 00:16:50.760
If we take care of her now, there will be nothing to fear.

00:16:57.140 --> 00:17:00.680
S-Something terrible has happened! K-Kazune-kun has…

00:17:00.930 --> 00:17:03.270
DEAD!

00:17:11.990 --> 00:17:16.160
So Kazune-chan… transformed into a god.

00:17:16.410 --> 00:17:17.450
Transformed?

00:17:17.450 --> 00:17:21.540
Yes, to change into the form of a god.

00:17:22.370 --> 00:17:24.870
Yeah. He was incredibly strong.

00:17:24.870 --> 00:17:30.300
He becomes strong, but afterwards he'll lose consciousness like this.

00:17:30.880 --> 00:17:34.880
So, Kazune-chan doesn't transform much.

00:17:35.340 --> 00:17:36.720
I see.

00:17:37.300 --> 00:17:42.060
He doesn't talk about it often, but it looks like he's very worried.

00:17:53.030 --> 00:17:59.530
When Kazune-chan was little, he was a big crybaby.

00:17:59.530 --> 00:18:01.910
Really? Unbelievable.

00:18:02.210 --> 00:18:08.920
All the kids would bully him, but I'd make them pay.

00:18:09.120 --> 00:18:11.920
Himeka-chan did? How unexpected.

00:18:11.920 --> 00:18:16.590
Kazune-chan and I don't have parents anymore…

00:18:17.380 --> 00:18:24.850
For as long as I can remember, I've always been with Kazune-chan.

00:18:24.850 --> 00:18:28.560
In a sense, I'm like his mother.

00:18:28.940 --> 00:18:32.270
So Kazune-kun doesn't have any parents either…

00:18:33.520 --> 00:18:40.700
But… when we were around ten, Kazune-chan changed.

00:18:40.700 --> 00:18:41.870
Changed?

00:18:49.170 --> 00:18:52.590
I'll become someone who can protect you, Himeka!

00:18:53.090 --> 00:18:54.750
I'll definitely protect you!

00:18:54.750 --> 00:18:57.010
I'll become stronger! Stronger!

00:19:05.180 --> 00:19:11.600
He came out of his room after three days, and suddenly said it just like that.

00:19:11.980 --> 00:19:13.110
Stronger…

00:19:14.610 --> 00:19:23.740
After that, his grades went up, he went to a dojo and became a better fighter.

00:19:24.780 --> 00:19:27.950
The only thing that hasn't changed is his phobia of bugs.

00:19:28.620 --> 00:19:36.750
He became stronger and he protected me, but it's like the Kazune-chan now…

00:19:36.750 --> 00:19:39.010
Why does he protect you?

00:19:40.130 --> 00:19:47.640
If I'm not protected, I might disappear.

00:19:48.730 --> 00:19:50.560
What do you mean?

00:19:50.560 --> 00:19:56.230
Kazune-chan won't tell me why… but…

00:19:56.230 --> 00:19:58.940
No way… how…

00:19:59.780 --> 00:20:03.360
Suddenly disappearing… I don't understand.

00:20:04.780 --> 00:20:08.490
But, but… that can't happen.

00:20:09.250 --> 00:20:11.250
Himeka-chan can't disappear!

00:20:13.120 --> 00:20:21.170
Kazune-kun tries his hardest not to transform into a god to protect Himeka-chan but…

00:20:23.010 --> 00:20:28.010
But for me, to save me…

00:20:29.470 --> 00:20:35.310
I finally started getting along with everyone and became part of their family… I…

00:20:36.110 --> 00:20:37.320
I also…

00:20:41.030 --> 00:20:44.070
I, I'll protect you too, Himeka-chan!

00:20:45.240 --> 00:20:47.580
Karin…-chan?

00:20:47.990 --> 00:20:50.450
Bullet or arrow, bring it!

00:20:50.450 --> 00:20:53.750
I'll protect you together with Kazune-kun!

00:20:54.670 --> 00:20:56.500
Karin-chan…

00:20:56.500 --> 00:21:00.630
I'm a mini-goddess! Leave it to me!

00:21:01.260 --> 00:21:02.720
Thank you.

00:21:04.090 --> 00:21:05.800
Kazune-chan.

00:21:05.800 --> 00:21:06.800
Are you awake?

00:21:07.470 --> 00:21:11.020
I did it again… I collapsed again.

00:21:11.020 --> 00:21:13.730
I was being so careful about it too… damn it.

00:21:13.730 --> 00:21:17.150
Don't worry, I'm here too!

00:21:17.150 --> 00:21:17.580
Huh?

00:21:17.680 --> 00:21:19.770
We're both gods so let's assist each other!

00:21:19.770 --> 00:21:21.400
What's this about?

00:21:21.990 --> 00:21:25.990
You're the one that said "You're not alone" Kazune-kun.

00:21:28.910 --> 00:21:30.910
Let's protect her together!

00:21:30.910 --> 00:21:34.370
Thank you… sorry that I'm weak.

00:21:34.370 --> 00:21:37.000
You're a man, right? Don't act so depressed!

00:21:37.750 --> 00:21:42.170
So from now on, please teach me how to fight, okay?

00:21:42.170 --> 00:21:43.760
Unreliable aren't you…

00:21:43.760 --> 00:21:48.930
What're you talking about? You're here because I was there!

00:21:48.930 --> 00:21:51.350
It's your fault I collapsed!

00:21:52.890 --> 00:21:57.400
It's been a while since I've seen you this carefree, Kazune-chan.

00:21:57.980 --> 00:21:59.690
I'm not being carefree!

00:22:02.030 --> 00:22:03.440
My new home…

00:22:04.780 --> 00:22:06.320
A new city…

00:22:07.240 --> 00:22:09.990
And my precious family.

00:22:10.740 --> 00:22:15.000
I'll live on with them.

00:22:19.880 --> 00:22:21.500
Now hurry and climb!

00:22:21.500 --> 00:22:23.460
If you can't do it, you don't get breakfast!

00:22:24.840 --> 00:22:29.680
We're family… so be a little kinder about it!

00:22:50.030 --> 00:22:55.500
Totsuzen no sutorii hajimaru yo

00:22:50.030 --> 00:22:55.500
The story has suddenly begun…

00:22:55.500 --> 00:23:03.860
Ring hikari dasu

00:22:55.500 --> 00:23:03.860
…with the ring shining.

00:23:03.860 --> 00:23:09.280
Ate no nai tabiji wo kimi to

00:23:03.860 --> 00:23:09.280
I'm on an aimless journey with you,

00:23:09.280 --> 00:23:15.750
Saa, hashire

00:23:09.280 --> 00:23:15.750
Come, let's run.

00:23:17.250 --> 00:23:31.180
Ima ruriiro somatta kono omoi wo

00:23:17.250 --> 00:23:31.180
Right now, these azure feelings that have built up…

00:23:31.180 --> 00:23:34.640
Yume mite koi shite

00:23:31.180 --> 00:23:34.640
…that I've been dreaming of, and love…

00:23:34.640 --> 00:23:45.030
Sora made ukande hakanai anemone

00:23:34.640 --> 00:23:45.030
…are floating up into the sky, like a never wilting anemone.

00:23:45.030 --> 00:23:52.080
Todoku koto no nai tegami hoshi no you ni

00:23:45.030 --> 00:23:52.080
This letter that cannot be delivered, will become like a star…

00:23:52.080 --> 00:24:01.880
So yo kaze sayonara aa…

00:23:52.080 --> 00:24:01.880
Yes, it will have have to bid the wind farewell.

00:24:05.320 --> 00:24:11.760
Reunion with Shii-chan

00:24:06.150 --> 00:24:08.150
Next time on Kami-chama Karin:

00:24:08.150 --> 00:24:10.250
Reunion with Shii-chan!

00:24:10.650 --> 00:24:13.870
Reunion with Shii-chan?!

00:24:13.870 --> 00:24:16.580
It can't be a ghost, right?

00:24:16.910 --> 00:24:19.040
I'm getting goose bumps.
